&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience building and operating production-grade software systems in complex environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience developing backend services in PHP, with the ability and desire to work language-agnostically and quickly learn new languages, frameworks, and codebases as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
