&lt;li&gt;Close business to meet and exceed monthly, quarterly and annual business targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate an extensive understanding of the Obsidian Security offering and our value to our customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align with our partners and alliances to optimize opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with internal resources across Sales Engineering, Customer Success and Professional Services&lt;/li&gt;
