&lt;li&gt;Drive initiatives that enhance our IT infrastructure, ensuring our solutions are robust, scalable, and secure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a key decision-maker in the selection and implementation of IT tools and practices that align with Remote&#39;s long-term vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
